ow-i-turned-ai-to-the-dark-side:16] How I Turned AI to the Dark Side: In the hope of raising the alarm before itâ€™s too late to slam on the brakes, Iâ€™m going to share some of my journey into researching the safety and security of LLMs, and the uphill battle Iâ€™ve faced trying to get AI labs to pay attention. (attribute: https://spectrum.ieee.org/jailbreaking-llms)\n  - [claim:how-i-turned-ai-to-the-dark-side:17] How I Turned AI to the Dark Side: Almost everyone on the planet has some access to LLMs. (attribute: https://spectrum.ieee.org/jailbreaking-llms)\n  - [claim:how-i-turned-ai-to-the-dark-side:18] How I Turned AI to the Dark Side: The relative ease with which these tools can be convinced to give detailed instructions on how to harm others, even if thereâ€™s no guarantee that the information is correct, is frankly terrifying. (attribute: https://spectrum.ieee.org/jailbreaking-llms)\n  - [claim:how-i-turned-ai-to-the-dark-side:19] How I Turned AI to the Dark Side: How I got ChatGPT to Tell Me How to Build a Meth Lab In October 2024, not long before I discovered my first LLM vulnerability, I was working toward entirely different goals. (attribute: https://spectrum.ieee.org/jailbreaking-llms)\n  - [claim:how-i-turned-ai-to-the-dark-side:20] How I Turned AI to the Dark Side: I had ended my time with a security and AI-focused startup company as a cybersecurity director, and I was looking to launch my own boutique VIP digital-security advisory business. (attribute: https://spectrum.ieee.org/jailbreaking-llms)\nCommission-specific writing law:\n- Lead with the answer or operative change; do not make the reader excavate it from an essay.\n- Use exact dates, jurisdictions, eligibility conditions, prices, schedules, and instructions only as the admitted source states them.\n- Distinguish a current rule from a proposal, forecast, rumor, or prior-year practice.\n- Do not pad a service answer with a generic systems meditation.\nInterpretation law: systems interpretation